          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I've heard great things about Snake Plants, but I'm also curious about the ZZ Plant. Can you tell me more about its watering schedule and how often it needs to be fertilized? By the way, I've been doing some redecorating and recently repainted my bedroom walls a lighter shade of gray - it's made the room feel so much brighter!"
